# How overlapping sounds are tamed when many UFOs act at once:
#   name: (priority, merge gap, max copies at the same time)
#   * merge gap  - the same sound can't restart within this many seconds, so
#                  five UFOs dying in one frame make one boom, not five.
#   * max copies - at most this many instances of one sound play together.
#   * priority   - when the global voice limit is reached, a more important
#                  sound replaces the least important one; quieter sounds are
