# ELEMENTAL ABILITIES: FROST, THUNDER, FIRE, POISON
#
# Keys (during a run): 1 = Frost, 2 = Thunder, 3 = Fire, 4 = Poison.
# Frost + Poison and Thunder + Fire are the only compatible pairs. Pressing
# the partner key while an element is active adds it to the synergy; other
# elements are ignored until the active effect expires.
#
#   FROST    hit UFOs are slowed (move AND shoot slower) for 3 s
#   THUNDER  hit UFOs are stunned (bosses only briefly, then immune a while)
#   FIRE     bullets fly faster; fire missiles / shockwaves / beams follow suit
#   POISON   hit UFOs take damage over time for 3 s
#
# COMBOS are automatic: while an element is active, the Charge beam (V),
# Shockwave (S) and homing Missiles (T) become the elemental version
# (Frost Charge, Thunder Shockwave, Poison Missile ...). The element in
# effect when you RELEASE a charge / fire a missile / start a shockwave is
# the one that is applied. Ricochet bullets and minion shots are imbued too.
